@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
hide empty members
title ST-02 交易生命周期
state "待接受" as Pending
state "已拒绝" as Refused
state "已撤回" as Withdrawn
state "已关闭" as Closed
state "进行中" as Ongoing
state "有争议" as Disputed
state "异常交易" as Abnormal
state "已终止" as Terminated
state "已完成" as Completed
[*] --> Pending : 有效购买请求
Pending --> Ongoing : 卖方接受 TR-11
Pending --> Refused : 拒绝 TR-12
Pending --> Withdrawn : 撤回 TR-13
Pending --> Closed : 锁单关闭／下架 BR-02
Ongoing --> Completed : 有效约定后双确认 TR-15
Ongoing --> Terminated : 按阶段取消 TR-17
Ongoing --> Disputed : 发起争议 TR-16
Ongoing --> Abnormal : 单方确认超时 TR-14
Disputed --> Ongoing : 已解决 TR-19
Disputed --> Terminated : 双方同意取消 TR-18
Abnormal --> Ongoing : 管理恢复 BR-08
Abnormal --> Completed : 管理完成 BR-08
Abnormal --> Terminated : 管理终止 BR-08
note left of Pending
待接受请求无自动有效期。
拒绝、撤回和关闭分别保留原因。
end note
note right of Ongoing
约定阶段与完成进度见ST-03。
争议结束原计时；恢复清当前确认、保留历史。
冻结为限制标记，不新增生命周期状态。
end note
note right of Abnormal
单方确认后7天未回应。
冻结限制双方推进，管理沟通保留。
管理调整须由认领人留据并通知。
end note
note bottom of Completed
完成／终止解本笔冻结及锁单、分支归档；
商品默认下架，卖方可按资格明确继续上架。
其他有效限制保留。管理调整可涉及全部状态，
本图绘制常见出口，完整约束见BR-08及4.15。
end note
@enduml
